  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of Bangladesh Reality Check</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utv&#xe4;rdering av Bangladesh Realtiy Check</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the evaluation of teh Reality Check Bangladesh is to   draw lessons from the RC  approach for future methods development and possible continuation of a similar initiative in Bangladesh. The RC   is a bottom-up approach that aims to provide information about poor   people&apos;s own perspectives on primary education and helath. It was     carried out between 2007-2011.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utv&#xe4;rderingen av Reality Check Bangladesh har som syfte att dra       generalla l&#xe4;rdomar f&#xf6;r Sidas fortsatta metodutveckling vg utv&#xe4;rdering samt att informera ambassadens beslut om eventuell forts&#xe4;ttning av en RC-liknande insats. RC Bangladesh har p&#xe5;g&#xe5;tt 2007-2011 och &#xe4;r en      metod f&#xf6;r att skapa st&#xf6;rre kunskap om fattiga m&#xe4;nnsikors perspektiv   p&#xe5; h&#xe4;lsa och utblidning.</narrative>
  </description>
